# Marketing library media (published from CMO-Agent).
# Posters + manifest ARE tracked (736K) so the grid renders; the 135MB of MP4s
# are not — this repo had zero video precedent and .git is only 59MB. The
# manifest carries absolute URLs when a video_base is configured, so the real
# home for the media is Supabase Storage / a CDN, not git.
public/marketing/assets/*.mp4
public/marketing/assets/*.webm
public/marketing/assets/*.mov
